SteamARM: Fill, Center and Move & Resize in XQuartz's Window menu

macOS 15's tiling commands for X windows, which are not NSWindows: Fill,
Center and a Move & Resize submenu with the halves, the quarters and
Return to Previous Size, after Zoom and before the list of windows. They
go to the window manager as an AppleWMControllerNotify of kind 32 with the
action in its argument (quartz-wm-tiling.patch); the wire format already
carries any kind and argument. Titled from AppKit's MenuCommands table, so
they read as the system's own in the app's language. AppKit's own items
(Fill, Center, Move & Resize, Full Screen Tile, Remove Window from Set)
only act on NSWindows, always off for X windows: hidden. No shortcuts:
AppKit keeps the Globe modifier for its own items only, and Control-F, C
and R alone belong to the X clients. XQUARTZ_NO_TILING_MENU=1 leaves the
menu as it was.
